### GraphQL: две Query и отказы
@api = http://localhost:4000

### Вход
# @name login
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "anna.smirnova@studytrack.demo", "password": "demo-pass-2026" }

### myCourses
POST {{api}}/graphql
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "query($page: Int!) { myCourses(page: $page, limit: 10) { total items { id title category { name } teacher { displayName } } } }", "variables": { "page": 1 } }

### assignment (подставьте id задания)
POST {{api}}/graphql
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "query($id: ID!) { assignment(id: $id) { title isOwner submissions(limit: 20) { total items { number isLate student { displayName } currentGrade { score } } } } }", "variables": { "id": "000000000000000000000000" } }

### limit больше 20 - VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{api}}/graphql
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "{ myCourses(limit: 50) { total } }" }

### Без токена - UNAUTHORIZED
POST {{api}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "{ myCourses { total } }" }
